  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28ac7c0d0b559b84888d3c9f20d1e419, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AsyncLoader
  loadingScreen: {fileID: 316050963}
  mainMenuScreen: {fileID: 1171806969}
  instructionScreen: {fileID: 664337954}
  loadingSlider: {fileID: 44720240}
  AudioSource: {fileID: 179254850}
  infoText:
  - 'You are the feline goddess Bastet. You must navigate the dark mazes of the Egyptian
    Underworld to find and rescue lost kitten souls. release them from their ancient
    urns and protect them as you guide them safely to Ra''s Sun Barge. But beware
    as not all that lurks in the DUat can be trusted '
  - 'Core Gameplay Rules\n\n Rescue: Walk up to and attack ancient clay urns to release
    the ghostly kittens trailing behind you. \n \nThe Price of Failure: You begin
    your journey with 9 Lives. If you take too much damage a life will be permanently
    lost.  \n\n The Sun Barge: The portal to safety is sealed tightly at the start
    of each level. You must locate and defeat the Level Boss to open the Sun Barge
    room.  \n\n The Ultimate Choice: Once your kittens are safely escorted to the
    Barge, choose wisely: progress to a deeper, more treacherous level to rescue
    more spirits, or risk it all to face Apophis, the Serpent of Chaos.  \n\n Permanent
    Growth: When you lose all 9 lives or choose to give up, use your safely banked
    kittens in the Underworld Shop to permanently upgrade your Speed, Attack Range,
    and Sight Range ready for the next evening.  '
  - Controls\n\n\n W, A, S, D / Arrow Keys - Movement.\n\n  Left Mouse Click - Use
    your Sistrum Rattle Unleash a sonic ring to stun chasing Spirits and to attack
    your enemies. \n \n Q - Sacrfice a Life  to save another \n1 life for 1 Kitten
  infoTextUI: {fileID: 1002559505}
  playButton: {fileID: 178867302}
